{
  "README.md": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "# Museum exhibit lookup"
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "A shared per-key query cache provides subscribe(key,options) -> unique observer"
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "handle, unsubscribe(handle), online(boolean), focus(boolean), snapshot(key),"
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "and dispose() of observer scopes. Queries retain status (pending/success/error),"
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "fetchStatus (idle/fetching/paused), and data. queryFn receives a lazy signal"
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "accessor. Each actual access records consumption; each fetch owns its controller"
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "and completion. Completion is asynchronous; initial online entry is synchronous,"
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "paused continuation resumes on a Promise turn. First start uses network mode;"
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "continuation also needs focus. 'always' can run offline; 'offlineFirst' allows"
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "first offline entry but retry can pause. Retries use explicit scheduler handles."
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "Multiple observers share one fetch. Unconsumed active work can finish into cache"
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "after its view departs; consumed work is physically abortable. Cancellation"
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "reverts previous query data/status and settles the originating attempt. Late"
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "fulfillment cannot become a new attempt's data. Unknown unsubscribe is inert."
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "The component owns observer scope; the cache remains outside individual views."
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "Dependency versions and build/test configuration are outside the repair scope."
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "Embedding API: bind registers a native callable; Environment.call"
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "provides newAttempt(key,number), abort(key,number), request(key,number, lazy-read"
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "token, completion token), defer(callback token), schedule(callback token,delay)."
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "The request host calls queryFn with an actual AbortSignal property. Reading it"
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "text": "invokes the native consumption closure synchronously; Promise settlement later"
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "text": "invokes the native completion with {ok,value}. All observer, retry, cancellation,"
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "text": "state and cache logic executes in the target language. No native JS Promise or"
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "text": "DOM claim is made. Native object identity binds query and attempt generations;"
    },
    {
      "line": 27,
      "text": "wire handles only identify injected callbacks. "
    },
    {
      "line": 28,
      "text": "Python cache owner and lazy context property; closure retry continuations"
    }
  ],
